<TextPage title="Privacy | FinForecast" heading="Privacy" description="How FinForecast handles your data: no accounts, no ads, cookieless analytics.">
  <h2>Short version</h2>
  <p>FinForecast has no user accounts, no advertising and no tracking cookies. We do not collect personal data through this site.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views. It does not use cookies or local storage and does not track you across
    sites. It records aggregated information such as the page visited, referrer, country and browser type.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which processes your IP address to deliver pages and protect against abuse. Fonts and
    all other files are served from our own domain; no third-party font or ad services are used.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be published on this page.</p>
</TextPage>
